@startuml SD_Product_Browse
!theme cerulean-outline

title Product Browse Flow\nAdventureWorks Sales BI Platform

actor       "User"               as User
participant "Browser / React\n(Products Page)" as React    #LightBlue
participant "Axios\napiClient"                  as Axios    #LightCyan
participant "ProductsController\n[AllowAnonymous]" as Controller #LightGreen
participant "ProductRepository"                 as Repo      #LightYellow
participant "OltpDbContext\n(SQL Server\nAdventureWorks2019)" as DB #LightPink

== Page Load ==

User -> React : Navigates to /products
React -> React : useEffect triggers\ndata fetch on mount

React -> Axios : CatalogService.getCategories()
Axios -> Controller : **GET /api/categories**
note right of Controller : CategoriesController\n[AllowAnonymous]
Controller -> DB : _db.Categories\n.AsNoTracking()\n.OrderBy(c => c.Name)
DB --> Controller : Category[]
Controller --> Axios : **200 OK** Category[]
Axios --> React : categories

React -> Axios : CatalogService.getProducts()
Axios -> Controller : **GET /api/products**
note right of Controller : ProductsController\n[AllowAnonymous]

Controller -> Repo : _repo.GetAllAsync()
Repo -> DB : _db.Products\n  .Include(x => x.Category)\n  .Include(x => x.SubCategory)\n  .AsNoTracking()\n  .OrderBy(x => x.Name)
DB --> Repo : List<Product>
Repo --> Controller : List<Product>

Controller -> Controller : Map to ProductDto[]\n(Id, Sku, Name, Description,\n Price, StockQty, ImageFileName,\n CategoryId, CategoryName,\n SubCategoryId, SubCategoryName)

Controller --> Axios : **200 OK**\nProductDto[]
Axios --> React : products[]

React -> React : Render product grid\nwith category filter sidebar

== Product Image Loading ==

loop For each product with ImageFileName
    React -> React : CatalogService.imgUrl(filename)\n=> http://localhost:57241\n   /images/product/{filename}
    React -> Axios : <img src={imgUrl} />
    Axios -> Controller : **GET /images/product/{filename}**
    note right of Controller : StaticFiles middleware\nPhysicalFileProvider\n=> C:\\images\\product\\
    Controller --> Axios : Image binary (PNG/JPG)
    Axios --> React : Rendered product image
end

== Category Filtering ==

User -> React : Selects a category\nfrom filter sidebar
React -> React : Filter products client-side\nby selected categoryId
React -> React : Re-render product grid\nshowing filtered results
React --> User : Filtered product list displayed

== Product Detail Navigation ==

User -> React : Clicks on a product card
React -> React : navigate(`/products/${id}`)
React -> Axios : CatalogService.getProduct(id)
Axios -> Controller : **GET /api/products/{id}**

Controller -> Repo : _repo.GetByIdAsync(id)
Repo -> DB : _db.Products\n  .Include(Category)\n  .Include(SubCategory)\n  .FirstOrDefaultAsync(x => x.Id == id)
DB --> Repo : Product | null

alt Product not found
    Repo --> Controller : null
    Controller --> Axios : **404 Not Found**
    Axios --> React : Error displayed
else Product found
    Repo --> Controller : Product
    Controller -> Controller : Map to ProductDto
    Controller --> Axios : **200 OK** ProductDto
    Axios --> React : product
    React --> User : Render ProductDetails page\nwith image, description,\nprice, stock, Add to Cart
end

@enduml
